WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.952
A common notebook workflow is to load data into a data frame and then register that data frame as a temporary view.

00:00:07.952 --> 00:00:13.642
Once the temporary view exists, we can query it with Spark S Q L.

00:00:13.642 --> 00:00:16.567
The word temporary is important.

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:21.227
This is not the same as a permanent database view from Module 12.

00:00:21.227 --> 00:00:27.332
A temporary Spark view usually belongs to the current session or notebook workflow.

00:00:27.332 --> 00:00:32.388
It is a convenient bridge between the data frame A P I and S Q L.
